<title>SINGAPORE: Keppel, PSA to hold news conference.</title>
<headline>Keppel, PSA to hold news conference.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Keppel Corporation Ltd and the Port Authority of Singapore (PSA) said on Monday they would hold a news conference on land development plans at 0800 GMT.</p>
<p>A joint statement said the session would be chaired by Khoo Teng Chye, PSA's president and Lim Chee Onn, senior executive director of Keppel Corp and chairman and managing director of Keppel Land Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65) 870-3080; Fax (65) 776-8112;</p>
<p>-- Email: singapore.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
</text>
